# Basic Stonehue GTP session.
# The test suite replays this file and expects no error replies.
# The random seed makes the genmove reply repeatable.
protocol_version
name
version
known_command genmove
known_command fly
list_commands
boardsize 9
clear_board
komi 6.5
stonehue_seed 20240709
stonehue_strength 1
play b D4
play w F4
play b D6
genmove w
showboard
undo
final_score
quit
